C('b2-argentinaregiones-01','The Look of the Pampa','You are Meg. You and Carlos are watching a documentary about the pampas, and he asks what the landscape is like.','Tell Carlos what the pampa looks like and what it really has.',['Grant that it looks flat','Say what it has in spite of that'],'Si bien la pampa parece plana, tiene paisajes muy variados.','Although the pampa looks flat, it has very varied landscapes.')
C('b2-argentinaregiones-02','The Grape of Mendoza','You are Carlos. You and Meg are reading an article about the wines of Mendoza, and she asks about the Malbec grape.','Tell Meg what happened to the Malbec grape over time.',['Say what the grape became','Say that it took time'],'Con el tiempo, el malbec llegó a convertirse en la uva más conocida del país.','In time, Malbec became the best-known grape of the country.')
C('b2-argentinaregiones-03','A Dry Valley','You are Meg. You and Carlos are watching a documentary about the Quebrada de Humahuaca, and he asks if people can live there.','Tell Carlos that the valley is dry but people live there.',['Say that the valley is dry','Contrast it with a fact about the communities'],'La quebrada es muy seca; sin embargo, allí viven muchas comunidades.','The ravine is very dry; however, many communities live there.')
